      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "When they released Groups, they said that it would be limited to VRC+ for a while. Once they are happy with the feature, they will make it available for everyone.\n\nThat aside, you don't have to remain a VRC+ subscriber to keep the Group. You can just get VRC+ for one month, make a Group (or more), and cancel the subscription.\n\nAlternatively, just wait for Group creation to be made available to everyone. I personally am looking forward to that day, since it might stop people from making those silly \"label groups\".",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
